# Go build output
/dist/
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# generated Windows resource (recreate with `go generate`)
*.syso

# embedded helper binaries (avifenc/exiftool+perl tree) — supplied at build time,
# baked into the exe via go:embed, NOT committed. Keep only the placeholder.
internal/assets/tools/windows/*
!internal/assets/tools/windows/README.txt

# one-time archive maintenance helpers: they reuse the library, but are NOT part
# of the shipped software and must never be committed (like journalcheck/gapfix)
/cmd/hataudit/

# tool runtime artifacts (these live in the user's archive, never in the repo)
image_compressor.db
image_compressor.db-wal
image_compressor.db-shm
image_compressor.log
*.log

# test scratch
/testdata/tmp/
*.tmp

# editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*~lock*
